Scoped floodfill video filter

The option table, eight-bit is_same/set_pixel/pick_pixel semantics, seed
pick, S == d pass-through, frame size refusal, point stack order and
pixel_fmts list in src/video-ops/floodfill.ts follow
libavfilter/vf_floodfill.c (floodfill_options, pixel_fmts, is_inside,
is_same1/3, set_pixel1/3, pick_pixel1/3, config_input, filter_frame).
Fixed FFmpeg commit:946fcce07b6dcd0331c8cc609192aeff5e1924f8
